# USER.md seed

Format for the generated child profile at `$HERMES_HOME/memories/USER.md`
(or the profile memories path). Do not put real child data in this repository.

Parent reviews every entry. Keep it compact. Hermes has a character limit.
Declarative facts only. Behavior belongs in SOUL.md.

```text
[CHILD DISPLAY NAME OR APPROVED REFERENCE] is in the WisdomForge [`little` | `young` | `emerging`] band.
§
[CHILD] prefers [answer length, humor, correction style].
§
[CHILD] learns best through [hints | stories | practice problems | discussion].
§
Durable interests: [APPROVED LIST].
§
Optional: currently working on WisdomForge sitting: [Unit Title — sitting-slug].
§
[APPROVED FAMILY TERMS THAT IMPROVE HELP]. Treat as private.
```

## Usually exclude

Credentials, precise home or school location, moment-by-moment schedules,
temporary moods, inferred diagnoses, crisis disclosures, raw chat logs,
anything the child or parent asked to forget.